# "Each player" (CR 101.4): all three players discard their hands and draw seven. The first player of a game of three draws on
# turn 1 (CR 103.8a), so Bot1 holds four Islands when it casts the Wheel off three Moxen; they and Bot2's and Bot3's seven
# cards each go to their own graveyards, and each draws seven (Bot1's graveyard: the Wheel and the four Islands).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Wheel of Fortune
Island x3
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wheel of Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 5
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 7
Bot3.Hand.Count = 7
Bot3.Graveyard.Count = 7
Bot2.Library.Count = 6
Bot3.Library.Count = 6
